From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 20:44:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] bonito: use the AIDL health.storage HAL

lineage-24.0 deleted hardware/interfaces/health/storage/1.0. The AIDL
default service is the same UFS/eMMC garbage-collect implementation, is
labelled hal_health_storage_default_exec by system file_contexts, and
runs in the same domain the device policy already extends.
---
 device.mk | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/device.mk b/device.mk
index 61a4cd75..c8457d97 100644
--- a/device.mk
+++ b/device.mk
@@ -336,7 +336,7 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
 
 # Storage health HAL
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
-    android.hardware.health.storage@1.0-service
+    android.hardware.health.storage-service.default
 
 # Light HAL
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
